{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28944","headline":"王秀才自越见寻不遇题诗而回因以酬寄 · 许浑","name":"王秀才自越见寻不遇题诗而回因以酬寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南斋知数宿，半爲木兰开。\n晴阁留诗遍，春帆载酒回。\n烟深杨子宅，云断越王台。\n自有孤舟兴，何妨更一来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}